  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Coral Reef Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Reef Authority hosted the Pacific Coral Reef Collective that brought together reef managers and designated partners from 14 Pacific countries (Secretariat of the Pacific Regional Environment Programme Pacific members) to address shared challenges facing coral reefs and explore the innovative solutions being implemented to improve reef resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
